    {
      "id": "89082084-1c3a-4db4-aec1-354195b1d115",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "The company",
      "position": {
        "x": -620,
        "y": 0
      },
      "width": 460,
      "height": 275,
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "style": {
        "background": "#1c2542",
        "color": "#f0f2ff",
        "borderColor": "#8573aa",
        "borderWidth": 1,
        "borderRadius": 16
      },
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "twilite-llc",
          "nodeId": "about"
        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Twilite LLC\n\nFounded in Louisiana in May 2026, Twilite LLC develops software for people who want to create, organize and keep connected work.\n\nThe company builds the environment. The user owns the direction."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4c805cdc-e21b-4ff2-be62-b1b7d94c8c9e",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "The product",
      "position": {
        "x": -80,
        "y": 0
      },
      "width": 460,
      "height": 275,
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "style": {
        "background": "#1c2542",
        "color": "#f0f2ff",
        "borderColor": "#8573aa",
        "borderWidth": 1,
        "borderRadius": 16
      },
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "twilite-llc",
          "nodeId": "product"
        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Twilite\n\nA graph-native workspace. Graphs can act as documents, visual interfaces, connected information and durable artifacts.\n\nThey are made to be read and edited by people and AI agents."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fce249fe-1f4c-428b-b564-61907d1e23a0",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "Bring your own agent",
      "position": {
        "x": 460,
        "y": 0
      },
      "width": 460,
      "height": 275,
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "style": {
        "background": "#1c2542",
        "color": "#f0f2ff",
        "borderColor": "#8573aa",
        "borderWidth": 1,
        "borderRadius": 16
      },
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "twilite-llc",
          "nodeId": "agent"
        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Bring your own agent\n\nTwilite is not tied to one AI model. Users can work directly with their graphs or bring an agent to help them build and modify them.\n\nThe graph remains when the conversation ends."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6d726b72-c720-4093-8bad-68a7d0b44006",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "Current chapter",
      "position": {
        "x": -620,
        "y": 350
      },
      "width": 460,
      "height": 275,
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "style": {
        "background": "#1c2542",
        "color": "#f0f2ff",
        "borderColor": "#8573aa",
        "borderWidth": 1,
        "borderRadius": 16
      },
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "twilite-llc",
          "nodeId": "status"
        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Preparing for launch\n\nPublic launch is the near-term goal, with Thanksgiving 2026 as the working target. Availability, features and pricing may change.\n\nThis page describes the direction, not a guarantee of release timing."
        }
      }
    },
