        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# At a glance\n\n- **Legal name:** Twilite LLC\n- **Jurisdiction:** Louisiana, USA\n- **Established:** May 2026\n- **Product:** Twilite\n- **Website:** https://twilite.zone"
        }
      }
    },
